		(uuid "d8b5dace-4b88-4b0c-847a-c720c7d39934")
	)
	(text "R210–R213 = 3.3 Ω: IFS = 3.3 V / (5 × 3.3 Ω) ≈ 200 mA; nominal 12 V / 1.25 W valve current ≈ 104 mA."
